OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to murder after
OL,4,A'senseless attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 52-year-old man who stabbed another
OL,7,Fman to death in a "senseless attack"
OL,8,Fhas admitted his murder.
OL,10,FScott Chambers, 52, brutally attacked
OL,11,FJames McMaster at a block of flats in
OL,12,FWishaw, Lanarkshire, on 30 November
OL,13,F2024 but told police he did not even
OL,14,Fknow the victim.
OL,16,FA friend of the 53-year-old discovered
OL,17,Fhis body on 5 December, having been
OL,18,Fworried that he had not heard from him.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
