OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to murder after
OL,4,A'senseless attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChambers had been due to stand trial at
OL,7,Fthe High Court in Glasgow this week but
OL,8,Finstead pled guilty to the murder
OL,9,Fcharge. He faces a life sentence when
OL,10,Fhe returns to the dock in the New Year.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
